WEBVTT

00:09.200 --> 00:10.433
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.500 --> 00:12.267
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.333 --> 00:13.833
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.900 --> 00:15.533
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.600 --> 00:18.733
* OH... *
* 哦... *

00:18.800 --> 00:20.800
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.867 --> 00:22.800
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.867 --> 00:25.100
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.167 --> 00:26.700
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.767 --> 00:28.900
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:28.967 --> 00:30.367
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.433 --> 00:32.933
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.000 --> 00:34.767
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.833 --> 00:36.700
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.767 --> 00:39.700
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:39.767 --> 00:40.733
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:40.800 --> 00:43.167
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:43.233 --> 00:45.500
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.567 --> 00:49.000
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.067 --> 00:50.933
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:03.133 --> 01:06.933
( with French accent ):
AH, IT IS SUNDAY MORNING
IN BIKINI BOTTOM
（带有法国口音）：
啊，现在是周日早上
比基尼下装

01:07.067 --> 01:08.467
AND IT IS ABOUT TIME
是时候了

01:08.533 --> 01:10.900
FOR SQUIDWARD TO PRACTICE
HIS CLARINET.
供章鱼哥练习
他的单簧管。

01:10.967 --> 01:12.933
SO GET YOUR EARPLUGS READY.
所以请准备好您的耳塞。

01:13.067 --> 01:14.067
MMM...
嗯……

01:14.100 --> 01:15.267
( smacks loudly )
（大声咂嘴）

01:15.333 --> 01:17.100
I THINK I'LL TREAT
BIKINI BOTTOM
我想我会治疗
比基尼泳裤

01:17.167 --> 01:18.300
TO SOME REAL MUSIC.
一些真正的音乐。

01:19.933 --> 01:21.200
( snoring )
（打鼾）

01:21.267 --> 01:23.100
( Gary meows )
（加里喵）

01:28.167 --> 01:28.967
( blasting )
（爆破）

01:29.067 --> 01:30.100
OW!
噢！

01:30.167 --> 01:33.333
( horn continues blowing )
（喇叭继续吹）

01:33.400 --> 01:35.567
GOOD MORNING,
SQUIDWARD!
早上好，
章鱼哥！

01:35.633 --> 01:37.367
WANT TO GO
JELLYFISHING?
想去
捕水母？

01:37.433 --> 01:39.233
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

01:39.300 --> 01:41.400
HOORAY!
万岁！

01:41.467 --> 01:43.167
WE'LL BE
RIGHT OVER.
我们会的
马上结束。

01:43.233 --> 01:44.367
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

01:44.433 --> 01:45.567
( grumbling )
（抱怨）

01:45.633 --> 01:46.900
( knock at door )
（敲门）

01:46.967 --> 01:48.867
I WONDER WHO THAT COULD BE.
我想知道那会是谁。

01:50.167 --> 01:52.100
READY TO GO?
准备好了吗？

01:52.167 --> 01:54.767
NO, I'M NOT
READY TO GO!
不，我不是
准备出发！

01:54.833 --> 01:56.867
HE DOESN'T WANT
TO PLAY WITH US.
他不想要
和我们一起玩。

01:56.933 --> 01:59.067
NO, PATRICK,
HE'S JUST NOT READY.
不，帕特里克，
他只是还没准备好。

01:59.100 --> 02:00.933
( knock at door )
（敲门）

02:01.967 --> 02:03.467
READY NOW?
现在准备好了吗？

02:03.533 --> 02:05.067
NO!
不！

02:06.133 --> 02:07.067
( knock at door )
（敲门）

02:07.133 --> 02:08.133
( grumbling )
（抱怨）

02:08.867 --> 02:09.800
HOW ABOUT NOW?
现在怎么样？

02:09.867 --> 02:10.733
NO!
不！

02:10.800 --> 02:12.433
HUH?
( knock )
嗯？
（敲）

02:12.500 --> 02:12.933
NOW?
现在？

02:13.067 --> 02:13.667
NO!
不！

02:13.733 --> 02:14.300
( knock )
（敲）

02:14.367 --> 02:14.967
NOW?
NO!
现在？
不！

02:15.067 --> 02:15.700
HOW ABOUT NOW?
现在怎么样？

02:15.767 --> 02:16.533
NO!
不！

02:16.600 --> 02:17.167
NO!
NOW?
不！
现在？

02:17.233 --> 02:17.967
NOW?
NO!
现在？
不！

02:18.067 --> 02:18.867
NO!
NOW?
不！
现在？

02:18.933 --> 02:19.767
NO!
不！

02:20.533 --> 02:21.267
WHAT?!
什么？！

02:21.333 --> 02:22.067
READY YET?
准备好了吗？

02:22.100 --> 02:23.233
NO, I'M NOT READY!
不，我还没准备好！

02:23.300 --> 02:24.567
I'LL NEVER BE READY.
我永远不会准备好。

02:24.633 --> 02:25.700
DON'T YOU GET IT?
你不明白吗？

02:25.767 --> 02:26.600
SURE, WE DO.
当然，我们愿意。

02:26.667 --> 02:27.600
WHAT?
什么？

02:27.667 --> 02:29.800
( mumbling )
（咕哝）

02:34.167 --> 02:35.100
READY?
准备好？

02:35.167 --> 02:36.233
( smack )
（咂嘴）

02:36.867 --> 02:38.400
OUT! JEESH!
出去！哎呀！

02:38.467 --> 02:40.667
SHOULDN'T YOU BE
AT WORK TODAY,
SPONGEBOB?
你不应该吗
今天工作时，
海绵宝宝？

02:40.733 --> 02:42.867
I'D LOVE TO BE AT WORK TODAY.
我今天很想上班。

02:42.933 --> 02:44.267
BUT IT'S SUNDAY.
但今天是周日。

02:44.333 --> 02:45.800
THE KRUSTY KRAB IS CLOSED.
甲壳蟹关门了。

02:47.167 --> 02:48.667
HOLD ON A SECOND.
请稍等。

02:48.733 --> 02:50.467
I'LL BE RIGHT OUT.
我马上就出去。

02:59.400 --> 03:00.933
HELLO?
你好？

03:01.067 --> 03:02.067
( silence )
（沉默）

03:02.133 --> 03:05.067
AH! ALONE AT LAST!
啊！最后独自一人！

03:05.067 --> 03:06.500
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

03:06.567 --> 03:08.900
SpongeBob and Patrick:
SQUIDWARD!
海绵宝宝和帕特里克：
章鱼哥！

03:08.967 --> 03:10.333
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

03:12.233 --> 03:14.133
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

03:14.200 --> 03:15.267
( wind howling )
（风呼啸）

03:15.333 --> 03:17.600
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

03:17.667 --> 03:20.533
OH, SQUIDWARD!
哦，章鱼哥！

03:20.600 --> 03:23.200
SQUIDWARD?!
章鱼哥？！

03:23.267 --> 03:24.467
WELL, HE'S NOT HERE.
好吧，他不在这里。

03:24.533 --> 03:26.633
I'LL BET THAT
EAGER BEAVER'S
ALREADY DOWN
我敢打赌
渴望海狸的
已经下来了

03:26.700 --> 03:27.800
AT JELLYFISH FIELDS.
在水母场。

03:27.867 --> 03:30.433
AHA! THEY'RE FINALLY GONE.
啊哈！他们终于走了。

03:32.533 --> 03:33.100
WHAT THE...?
什么是...？

03:33.167 --> 03:34.100
LOCKED?
锁定？

03:34.167 --> 03:35.567
OH, NO!
哦，不！

03:35.633 --> 03:37.967
OH, WELL,
SOMEONE WILL REALIZE I'M GONE
哦，好吧，
有人会意识到我已经走了

03:38.067 --> 03:39.533
AND COME LOOKING FOR ME.
来找我吧。

03:39.600 --> 03:42.600
I'LL BE OUT OF HERE IN NO TIME.
我很快就会离开这里。

03:49.967 --> 03:52.933
( computer beeping )
（电脑发出嘟嘟声）

04:00.300 --> 04:02.067
HOLY KRABBY PATTIES!
神圣的蟹肉饼！

04:02.133 --> 04:04.067
A FROZEN CEPHALOPOD.
冷冻头足类动物。

04:08.367 --> 04:10.467
( zapping )
（电击）

04:10.533 --> 04:13.067
( screaming )
（尖叫）

04:13.133 --> 04:16.067
( trancelike ):
I'LL BE OUT OF HERE IN NO TIME.
（恍惚状）：
我很快就会离开这里。

04:16.067 --> 04:17.167
GREETINGS, PRIMITIVE.
你好，原始人。

04:17.233 --> 04:19.067
SP... SPONGEBOB?
SP...海绵宝宝？

04:19.133 --> 04:20.567
IS THAT YOU?
那是你吗？

04:20.633 --> 04:21.633
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

04:21.700 --> 04:22.833
NO!
不！

04:22.900 --> 04:24.733
Mechanized voice:
I am SpongeTron.
机械化语音：
我是海绵世界。

04:24.800 --> 04:26.567
WELCOME
TO THE FUTURE.
欢迎
走向未来。

04:26.633 --> 04:27.567
WHAT?
什么？

04:27.633 --> 04:29.400
WELCOME TO THE FUTURE.
欢迎来到未来。

04:29.467 --> 04:32.700
UH... THE FUTURE?
呃……未来？

04:32.767 --> 04:33.700
HUH?
嗯？

04:33.767 --> 04:35.567
( electronic pulsing )
（电子脉冲）

04:35.633 --> 04:37.333
OKAY, WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
好吧，这是怎么回事？

04:37.400 --> 04:39.667
WHY IS EVERYTHING CHROME?
为什么一切都是镀铬的？

04:39.733 --> 04:42.167
EVERYTHING IS CHROME
IN THE FUTURE.
一切都是镀铬的
未来。

04:42.233 --> 04:44.267
WHA... UH... UH...
什...呃...呃...

04:45.133 --> 04:47.867
OH, MY!
哦，天哪！

04:47.933 --> 04:49.867
IMPOSSIBLE!
不可能的！

04:49.933 --> 04:51.867
HE'S LYING!
他在撒谎！

04:51.933 --> 04:54.200
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

04:54.267 --> 04:55.367
( tires squeal )
（轮胎吱吱声）

04:59.533 --> 05:01.867
HE'S RIGHT!
他是对的！

05:01.933 --> 05:04.133
SpongeTron:
OF COURSE I'M
RIGHT, SQUIDWARD.
海绵世界：
我当然是
对了，章鱼哥。

05:04.200 --> 05:05.267
JUST ASK MY CLONES--
问问我的克隆人就知道了——

05:05.333 --> 05:07.433
SPONGETRONS X, Y AND Z.
海绵体 X、Y 和 Z。

05:07.500 --> 05:11.367
ARE THE... OTHER LETTERS
OF THE ALPHABET INVOLVED HERE?
是……其他字母吗
这里涉及的字母是什么？

05:11.433 --> 05:13.800
SURE-- ALL 486 OF THEM.
当然——全部 486 个。

05:20.733 --> 05:23.733
FUTURE!
未来！

05:23.800 --> 05:26.933
FUTURE!
未来！

05:27.067 --> 05:30.200
FUTURE!
未来！

05:30.267 --> 05:33.067
FUTURE!
未来！

05:33.067 --> 05:34.267
THANKS.
谢谢。

05:34.333 --> 05:35.267
NOW, LISTEN.
现在，听。

05:35.333 --> 05:36.267
ALL OF YOU!
你们所有人！

05:36.333 --> 05:37.967
I DON'T BELONG HERE.
我不属于这里。

05:38.067 --> 05:40.600
THIS IS ALL
A HORRIBLE MISTAKE.
这就是全部
一个可怕的错误。

05:40.667 --> 05:42.667
PLEASE, WE'VE GOT
TO DO SOMETHING!
拜托，我们有
做点什么！

05:42.733 --> 05:44.400
All:
JELLYFISHING!
全部：
捕水母！

05:44.467 --> 05:46.767
( loud static )
（大声的静电声）

05:46.833 --> 05:49.133
DID SOMEBODY SAY "JELLYFISHING"?
有人说“水母捕捞”吗？

05:49.200 --> 05:50.467
HI, PAT-TRON!
嗨，帕特隆！

05:50.533 --> 05:52.733
J-JUST LISTEN TO ME.
J-听我说。

05:52.800 --> 05:54.633
I'M NOT SUPPOSED TO BE HERE.
我不应该在这里。

05:54.700 --> 05:57.533
I'VE GOT TO GET HOME
TO MY OWN TIME PERIOD.
我得回家了
到我自己的时间段。

05:57.600 --> 05:59.067
I GOT TO GO!
我得走了！

05:59.067 --> 06:00.500
WHY DIDN'T YOU JUST ASK?
你为什么不直接问？

06:00.567 --> 06:03.100
THE TIME MACHINE IS
DOWN THE HALL, TO THE LEFT.
时间机器是
沿着大厅，向左。

06:04.700 --> 06:06.900
( laughing gleefully )
（高兴地笑）

06:06.967 --> 06:09.733
( machine humming loudly )
（机器嗡嗡作响）

06:12.200 --> 06:13.367
SpongeTron:
OOPS!
海绵世界：
哎呀！

06:13.433 --> 06:15.833
OH, YEAH,
THAT ONE'S THE CAN OPENER.
哦，是的，
那是开罐器。

06:15.900 --> 06:18.300
BUT TRY THE ONE
ON THE RIGHT.
但尝试一下这个
在右边。

06:21.233 --> 06:25.267
WELL, I WOULDN'T HAVE CHOSEN
THIS INTERIOR.
好吧，我不会选择
这个内饰。

06:25.333 --> 06:26.533
OH, WHAT'S THIS?
哦，这是什么？

06:26.600 --> 06:30.567
WELL, IF SPONGEBOB
EXISTS IN THE FUTURE
好吧，如果海绵宝宝
存在于未来

06:30.633 --> 06:33.367
I'D BETTER GO TO THE PAST.
我最好回到过去。

06:33.433 --> 06:38.133
( siren beeping )
（警报器鸣响）

06:52.267 --> 06:53.700
WOW!
哇！

06:53.767 --> 06:55.867
PRIMITIVE.
原始。

06:55.933 --> 06:58.667
HAS SORT OF AN OLD-WORLD CHARM.
有一种旧世界的魅力。

06:58.733 --> 07:00.133
WHOA!
哇啊！

07:00.200 --> 07:03.933
I GUESS THIS IS BEFORE
MANNERS WERE INVENTED!
我想这是之前
礼仪被发明了！

07:04.067 --> 07:06.367
WELL, AT LEAST THERE'S
NO SIGN OF SPONGEBRAT.
好吧，至少有
没有海绵宝宝的迹象。

07:06.433 --> 07:10.067
MAYBE NOW I CAN FINALLY
BE ALONE WITH MY CLARINET.
也许现在我终于可以了
单独演奏我的单簧管。

07:10.067 --> 07:11.233
( rustling nearby )
（附近有沙沙声）

07:14.967 --> 07:15.967
( bang )
（砰）

07:21.233 --> 07:21.833
( whoosh )
（嗖嗖）

07:21.900 --> 07:23.067
HUH?
嗯？

07:23.900 --> 07:24.567
WHAT?
什么？

07:25.333 --> 07:25.867
HUH?
嗯？

07:29.067 --> 07:30.133
( screams )
（尖叫声）

07:30.200 --> 07:31.700
( chomping )
（咀嚼）

07:34.167 --> 07:35.867
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

07:35.933 --> 07:37.133
( yells )
（大喊）

07:37.200 --> 07:38.833
STAY BACK!
退后！

07:41.667 --> 07:43.167
( sniffing )
（嗅）

07:43.233 --> 07:44.867
UH, NO THANKS.
呃，不用了，谢谢。

07:44.933 --> 07:48.433
( heavy breathing
nearby )
（呼吸粗重
附近）

07:55.833 --> 07:58.100
UH... HI THERE.
呃……你好。

07:58.167 --> 07:59.700
WELL, I BETTER BE GOING NOW.
好吧，我最好现在就走。

07:59.767 --> 08:01.100
( hooting like monkey )
（像猴子一样叫）

08:01.167 --> 08:03.067
YES, THAT'S MY ARM.
是的，那是我的手臂。

08:07.500 --> 08:08.800
OH, THAT'S SWEET.
哦，太甜了。

08:08.867 --> 08:12.200
( bellowing )
（吼叫）

08:12.267 --> 08:14.667
WHAT, IS IT TIME
FOR YOUR FLEA BATH NOW?
什么，现在到了吗
现在要进行跳蚤浴吗？

08:14.733 --> 08:15.867
( bones rattling )
（骨头嘎嘎作响）

08:15.933 --> 08:17.633
OH, IT'S JUST
A LITTLE JELLYFISH.
哦，这只是
一只小水母。

08:18.733 --> 08:24.567
( yelling frantically )
（疯狂地大喊）

08:24.633 --> 08:27.067
( hooting in alarm )
（警报鸣叫）

08:27.100 --> 08:29.767
WELL, I'M GOING AWAY NOW.
好吧，我现在要走了。

08:29.833 --> 08:31.233
AH!
啊！

08:31.300 --> 08:35.633
HERE'S A NICE, SHADY SPOT,
AWAY FROM THOSE FOOLS.
这是一个漂亮、阴凉的地方，
远离那些傻瓜。

08:35.700 --> 08:37.067
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

08:37.133 --> 08:40.600
( SpongeBob
hooting )
（海绵宝宝
鸣叫）

08:40.667 --> 08:42.800
( Patrick
bellowing )
（帕特里克
吼叫）

08:42.867 --> 08:45.767
( SpongeBob
screaming )
（海绵宝宝
尖叫）

08:46.700 --> 08:47.667
( zap )
（扎普）

08:47.733 --> 08:50.533
( howling )
（嚎叫）

08:50.600 --> 08:51.533
( zap )
（扎普）

08:51.600 --> 08:53.867
( yelling )
（大喊）

08:53.933 --> 08:55.967
WHAT ARE YOU
SIMPLETONS DOING?!
你是什么？
简单人在做什么？！

08:56.067 --> 08:58.267
YOU'RE SUPPOSED
TO CATCH THESE THINGS--
你应该
为了抓住这些东西——

08:58.333 --> 09:00.100
NOT TORTURE YOURSELF
WITH THEM.
不要折磨自己
和他们在一起。

09:01.933 --> 09:04.200
GIVE ME
THOSE LOINCLOTHS!
给我
那些腰布！

09:07.133 --> 09:08.500
I CAN'T BELIEVE IT.
我简直不敢相信。

09:08.567 --> 09:09.867
( mumbling )
（咕哝）

09:09.933 --> 09:12.667
THIS OUGHT
TO MAKE THINGS GO
A LITTLE SMOOTHER.
这应该
让事情顺利进行
更顺畅一点。

09:12.733 --> 09:17.533
( whimpering )
（呜咽）

09:17.600 --> 09:19.400
GIVE ME THOSE THINGS!
把那些东西给我！

09:19.467 --> 09:23.100
YOU'RE SUPPOSED
TO CATCH THEM-- LIKE THIS.
你应该
抓住他们——就像这样。

09:23.167 --> 09:26.567
IT'S CALLED JELLYFISHING.
这就是所谓的“捕水母”。

09:26.633 --> 09:31.067
( both grunting
stupidly )
（两人都咕哝着
愚蠢地）

09:34.400 --> 09:36.900
AH, FINALLY!
啊，终于！

09:36.967 --> 09:38.167
( inhales deeply )
（深吸一口气）

09:38.233 --> 09:43.733
( playing squeaky tune )
（演奏吱吱作响的曲子）

09:43.800 --> 09:47.667
( yelling angrily )
（愤怒地大喊）

09:57.700 --> 09:58.667
( screams )
（尖叫声）

09:58.733 --> 10:00.833
GET ME OUT OF HERE.
带我离开这里。

10:00.900 --> 10:02.133
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

10:05.000 --> 10:05.900
Machine voice:
Loser.
机器声音：
失败者。

10:05.967 --> 10:07.333
( bellowing wildly )
（疯狂地吼叫）

10:07.400 --> 10:08.733
( electronic whirring )
（电子呼呼声）

10:12.000 --> 10:14.667
( alarm beeping )
（警报声）

10:26.600 --> 10:27.667
( electronic zap )
（电子 ZAP ）

10:34.267 --> 10:37.933
( voice echoing eerily )
（声音诡异地回响）

10:38.000 --> 10:39.133
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

10:41.733 --> 10:43.467
HE'S NOT HERE.
他不在这里。

10:43.533 --> 10:45.767
NO MORE SPONGEBOB.
不再有海绵宝宝了。

10:45.833 --> 10:47.233
NO MORE!
不再！

10:47.300 --> 10:52.600
I MAY FINALLY HAVE FOUND
A PLACE WHERE I CAN BE ALL...
我可能终于找到了
一个我可以全身心投入的地方...

10:53.833 --> 10:55.733
ALONE!
独自的！

10:55.800 --> 11:00.467
Various voices:
ALONE... ALONE... ALONE...
各种声音：
单独...单独...单独...

11:04.667 --> 11:09.567
( voices echoing )
（声音回响）

11:10.500 --> 11:12.667
I GOT TO GET OUT OF HERE!
我必须离开这里！

11:12.733 --> 11:13.833
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

11:13.900 --> 11:16.300
( voices echoing eerily )
（声音诡异地回响）

11:19.933 --> 11:22.167
WHERE'S THE TIME MACHINE?!
时间机器在哪里？！

11:22.233 --> 11:23.600
WHERE'S ANYTHING?
有什么东西吗？

11:23.667 --> 11:26.133
WHERE, WHERE, WHERE, WHERE...!
哪里，哪里，哪里，哪里……！

11:28.767 --> 11:30.067
I WANT TO GO HOME.
我想回家。

11:30.067 --> 11:31.067
I WANT TO GO HOME.
我想回家。

11:31.133 --> 11:32.067
I WANT TO GO HOME.
我想回家。

11:32.133 --> 11:33.133
I WANT TO GO HOME.
我想回家。

11:33.200 --> 11:34.367
I MISS BIKINI BOTTOM.
我想念比基尼泳裤。

11:34.433 --> 11:36.133
I MISS MY EASTER ISLAND HEAD.
我想念我的复活节岛头。

11:36.200 --> 11:38.633
I EVEN MISS SPONGEBOB.
我什至想念海绵宝宝。

11:45.067 --> 11:48.067
SPONGEBOB! PATRICK!
海绵宝宝！帕特里克！

11:48.067 --> 11:49.433
Both:
HI, SQUIDWARD.
两者：
嗨，章鱼哥。

11:49.500 --> 11:50.767
OH, I'M BACK!
哦，我回来了！

11:50.833 --> 11:52.067
I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS.
我不敢相信这一点。

11:52.133 --> 11:54.233
I-I-I WAS IN SPACE
AND I WENT TO THE FUTURE
我-我-我在太空
我走向了未来

11:54.300 --> 11:56.933
AND THEN I WENT TO THE PAST,
AND THEN I WAS NOWHERE
然后我回到了过去，
然后我就不知去向了

11:57.067 --> 11:59.467
BUT NOW I'M BACK
但现在我回来了

11:59.533 --> 12:04.500
AND YOU DON'T KNOW
HOW HAPPY I AM
TO SEE YOU GUYS.
而你不知道
我多么高兴
见到你们。

12:04.567 --> 12:06.900
DOES THIS MEAN
YOU WANT TO GO...
这是否意味着
你想去...

12:06.967 --> 12:09.067
Both:
JELLYFISHING?!
两者：
捕水母？！

12:09.133 --> 12:10.267
NO!
不！

12:10.333 --> 12:11.800
D'OH!
天啊！

12:11.867 --> 12:13.500
WHO'S THE BARNACLEHEAD
谁是藤壶头

12:13.567 --> 12:15.833
WHO INVENTED
THAT GAME, ANYWAY?
谁发明的
那个游戏，无论如何？

12:15.900 --> 12:18.967
Both:
YOU ARE, SQUIDWARD.
两者：
你是，章鱼哥。

12:19.067 --> 12:20.800
( Patrick and SpongeBob
laughing )
（帕特里克和海绵宝宝
笑）

12:20.867 --> 12:22.233
Squidward.
I'M GOING BACK.
章鱼哥。
我要回去了。

12:36.833 --> 12:38.333
( whacks )
（重击）

12:42.533 --> 12:43.467
( yells )
（大喊）

12:43.533 --> 12:44.433
KIAI!
凯艾！

12:44.500 --> 12:46.367
OH, SORRY, PINEAPPLE HOUSE.
哦，对不起，菠萝屋。

12:46.433 --> 12:49.167
I THOUGHT YOU WERE SOMEONE ELSE.
我以为你是别人。

12:49.233 --> 12:51.333
AH! WHAT A GREAT DAY AT WORK.
啊！多么美好的一天啊。

12:51.400 --> 12:53.067
( clattering
nearby )
（咔哒声
附近）

12:55.467 --> 12:57.100
YEAH!
是的！

12:58.433 --> 13:02.233
( footsteps quacking )
（嘎嘎的脚步声）

13:02.300 --> 13:03.300
( groaning )
（呻吟）

13:05.400 --> 13:09.333
I KNOW YOU'RE BACK THERE, SANDY.
我知道你回来了，桑迪。

13:09.400 --> 13:12.767
AND I ALSO KNOW THAT
NOBODY CAN HIDE FROM SPONGE...
我也知道
没有人能躲过海绵……

13:12.833 --> 13:14.500
BOB.
鲍勃。

13:20.967 --> 13:22.133
I GOT YOU NOW!
我现在找到你了！

13:22.200 --> 13:23.733
KIAI!
凯艾！

13:25.233 --> 13:28.633
WELL, I GUESS
THE COAST IS CLEAR.
嗯，我猜
海岸清澈见底。

13:28.700 --> 13:29.933
Yeah, shopping's weird.
是的，购物很奇怪。

13:30.067 --> 13:32.100
Did you ever go
into the seafood aisle
你有没有去过
进入海鲜通道

13:32.167 --> 13:33.900
and say, "Who eats this stuff?"
并说：“谁吃这些东西？”

13:33.967 --> 13:34.967
( laughing )
（笑）

13:35.067 --> 13:36.667
I LOVE THIS SHOW!
我喜欢这个节目！

13:36.733 --> 13:37.700
ME, TOO.
我也是。

13:37.767 --> 13:39.067
( screams )
（尖叫声）

13:39.067 --> 13:42.467
( karate yelling )
（空手道大喊）

13:43.900 --> 13:45.133
UH, JUST A SECOND.
呃，请等一下。

13:46.300 --> 13:48.067
SAFETY FIRST.
安全第一。

13:48.067 --> 13:50.567
AND NOW,
SPIN TECHNIQUE.
现在，
旋转技术。

13:50.633 --> 13:52.367
( yelling )
（大喊）

13:52.433 --> 13:54.100
( yells )
（大喊）

13:54.167 --> 13:57.500
DOUBLE OVERHAND
SQUIRREL KNOT.
双上手
松鼠结。

13:57.567 --> 13:59.767
( bowling ball rumbling,
striking pins )
（保龄球隆隆作响，
敲击销）

13:59.833 --> 14:02.800
I'M GOING TO GET YOU
TOMORROW, SPONGEBOB.
我会去找你
明天，海绵宝宝。

14:02.867 --> 14:04.433
THAT'LL BE THE DAY.
那一天就会到来。

14:04.500 --> 14:09.400
WHOOP, WHOOP, WHOOP,
WHOOP, WHOOP, WHOOP...
呼啦，呼啦，呼啦，
呜呜呜呜呜……

14:09.467 --> 14:11.767
( humming to herself )
（自言自语）

14:11.833 --> 14:13.133
( phone cuckooing )
（电话咕咕叫）

14:14.933 --> 14:16.633
HELLO.
你好。

14:16.700 --> 14:18.400
KIAI! KIAI!
凯艾！凯艾！

14:21.400 --> 14:24.700
NICE TRY, SPONGEBRAIN.
不错的尝试，海绵大脑。

14:31.267 --> 14:32.400
( yells )
（大喊）

14:35.233 --> 14:37.900
HEY, SANDY,
HAVE YOU EVER HEARD THE ONE
嘿，桑迪，
你听过吗

14:37.967 --> 14:40.433
ABOUT THE SQUIRREL
AND THE TIN CANS?
关于松鼠
还有锡罐？

14:40.500 --> 14:41.967
UH, DON'T THINK SO.
呃，别这么想。

14:42.067 --> 14:43.867
WELL, IT GOES LIKE THIS.
嗯，事情是这样的。

14:45.567 --> 14:46.867
OH, WAIT, I FORGOT
THE PUNCH LINE.
哦，等等，我忘了
打孔线。

14:46.933 --> 14:47.933
( screeches )
（尖叫声）

14:48.067 --> 14:49.167
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

14:53.600 --> 14:54.800
( laughing )
（笑）

14:54.867 --> 14:56.833
THAT'S A GOOD ONE, ISN'T IT?
这很好，不是吗？

14:56.900 --> 14:59.533
WHAT A BEAUTIFUL DAY.
多么美好的一天啊。

14:59.600 --> 15:01.500
BEAUTIFUL SKY, BEAUTIFUL PLANTS.
美丽的天空，美丽的植物。

15:01.567 --> 15:03.500
HI, PLANTS.
嗨，植物。

15:03.567 --> 15:04.700
BEAUTIFUL...
美丽的...

15:04.767 --> 15:06.333
PILE OF CANS.
一堆罐头。

15:06.400 --> 15:07.667
MMM-MMM.
嗯嗯。

15:07.733 --> 15:10.800
SANDY, THAT IS YOUR
WORST DISGUISE YET.
桑迪，那是你的
最糟糕的伪装。

15:10.867 --> 15:12.167
NO, IT'S NOT,
SPONGEBOB.
不，不是，
海绵宝宝。

15:12.233 --> 15:14.200
THIS IS.
这是。

15:14.267 --> 15:15.867
NOW, PREPARE
现在，准备

15:15.933 --> 15:19.700
FOR A LONG,
MERCILESS WHOOPING.
长期以来，
无情的呼喊。

15:20.733 --> 15:22.267
MMM, MMM.
嗯，嗯。

15:22.333 --> 15:23.933
MY FAVORITE.
我最喜欢的。

15:29.267 --> 15:31.700
( laughing evilly )
（邪恶地笑）

15:31.767 --> 15:34.867
BY THE POWERS OF NAUGHTINESS
顽皮的力量

15:34.933 --> 15:38.067
I COMMAND THIS PARTICULAR
DROP OF HOT SAUCE
我特别要求
滴辣酱

15:38.133 --> 15:42.067
TO BE REALLY, REALLY HOT!
真的、真的很热！

15:42.100 --> 15:44.933
THANDY, WAIT!
桑迪，等等！

15:45.067 --> 15:46.300
VICTORY IS YOURTH.
胜利就是青春。

15:46.367 --> 15:48.933
I KNEW YOU'D COME
TO YOUR SENSES, SPONGEBOB.
我知道你会来
就你的感觉而言，海绵宝宝。

15:59.100 --> 16:01.167
WHOA!
哇啊！

16:01.233 --> 16:02.833
KIAI!
凯艾！

16:02.900 --> 16:04.733
CURSES...!
诅咒...！

16:04.800 --> 16:07.633
Exasperated customer:
OH, WHAT IS GOING ON?!
愤怒的顾客：
哦，这是怎么回事？

16:07.700 --> 16:08.833
WITH EXTRA CHEESE,
TO GO.
加上额外的奶酪，
去吧。

16:08.900 --> 16:10.867
THREE PATTIES,
FOUR LARGE OYSTER SKINS
三个肉饼，
四块大牡蛎皮

16:10.933 --> 16:12.333
ON THE DOUBLE, SPONGEBOB.
双打，海绵宝宝。

16:13.567 --> 16:14.700
OH, YEAH.
哦，是的。

16:14.767 --> 16:15.700
GOT YOU!
找到你了！

16:15.767 --> 16:16.767
SPONGEBOB...
海绵宝宝...

16:18.267 --> 16:20.400
I'M GOING TO PRETEND
THAT DIDN'T HAPPEN.
我要假装
但那并没有发生。

16:20.467 --> 16:22.833
NOW, FILL THESE ORDERS
OR LEAVE, SPONGEBOB.
现在，填写这些订单
或者离开，海绵宝宝。

16:22.900 --> 16:26.100
WE'RE VERY BUSY TODAY.
我们今天很忙。

16:26.167 --> 16:27.867
ORDER... OH!
订单...哦！

16:27.933 --> 16:29.933
( fly buzzing )
（苍蝇嗡嗡作响）

16:30.067 --> 16:31.200
AH...
啊...

16:35.067 --> 16:36.900
SPONGEBOB, NOW,
ARE YOU GOING TO...
海绵宝宝，现在，
你打算...

16:36.967 --> 16:38.333
Mr. Krabs:
OH, SQUIDWARD
蟹老板先生：
哦，章鱼哥

16:38.400 --> 16:39.733
I WAS GOING
THROUGH SOME RECORDS
我正要去
通过一些记录

16:39.800 --> 16:41.100
BACK IN ME OFFICE,
AND... HUH?
回到我的办公室，
还有……嗯？

16:41.167 --> 16:43.233
SO, YOU GOT THE
HAIRPIECE AFTER ALL.
所以，你得到了
毕竟是假发。

16:43.300 --> 16:45.233
( SpongeBob yelling )
（海绵宝宝大喊大叫）

16:45.300 --> 16:47.467
THOUGHT YOU COULD
SNEAK UP ON ME
我以为你可以
偷偷靠近我

16:47.533 --> 16:48.733
AT WORK, DID YOU?
你在工作吗？

16:48.800 --> 16:49.800
WELL, YOU CAN'T
好吧，你不能

16:49.867 --> 16:51.633
BECAUSE
I'M FAST, I'M MEAN
因为
我很快，我很刻薄

16:51.700 --> 16:53.067
AND I CAN DO THIS.
我能做到。

16:54.867 --> 16:56.067
SSS!
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！
SSS！

16:58.133 --> 17:00.400
TOOK CARE OF HER,
YES, I DID.
照顾她，
是的，我做到了。

17:00.467 --> 17:01.533
OH! AHOY, SIR.
哦！哎哟，先生。

17:01.600 --> 17:02.833
WHAT WAS THAT?
那是什么？

17:02.900 --> 17:05.833
BUT SIR,
SHE SNUCK UP ON ME.
但是先生，
她偷偷靠近我。

17:05.900 --> 17:08.933
IN MY OWN DOJO.
在我自己的道场里。

17:09.067 --> 17:11.967
ARE YOU ON SOME NEW
ALLERGY MEDICATION, BOY?
你有新的吗
过敏药物，男孩？

17:12.067 --> 17:14.400
NO, SIR, JUST PRACTICING
MY KARATE, SIR--
不，先生，只是练习
我的空手道，先生——

17:14.467 --> 17:16.433
OR KARA-TAY, AS SOME CALL IT.
或有人称之为 KARA-TAY。

17:16.500 --> 17:17.867
"KARA-TAY"?
“卡拉泰”？

17:17.933 --> 17:20.267
YOU SHOULD BE MAKING ME
MONEY-AY
你应该让我
钱-AY

17:20.333 --> 17:22.067
WITH YOUR SPATU-LAY.
用你的锅铲。

17:22.067 --> 17:23.600
NOW, GET BACK TO WORK.
现在，回去工作吧。

17:23.667 --> 17:25.467
AY-AY, CAPITAY.
是的，是的，资本。

17:25.533 --> 17:27.067
NICE HAIRPIECE,
SQUIDWARD.
漂亮的发饰，
章鱼哥。

17:30.600 --> 17:33.233
SPONGEBOB, DID YOU GET
THOSE BATHROOMS MOPPED YET?
海绵宝宝，你收到了吗
那些浴室擦干净了吗？

17:33.300 --> 17:34.733
YES, MA'AM... I MEAN SIR
是的，女士……我是说先生

17:34.800 --> 17:36.400
I MEAN BOSS,
I MEAN POOH-BAH.
我的意思是老板，
我的意思是呸呸。

17:36.467 --> 17:37.533
D'OH!
天啊！

17:39.167 --> 17:40.367
( someone sneezes )
（有人打喷嚏）

17:48.467 --> 17:49.600
HA!
哈！

17:53.700 --> 17:54.700
SANDY!
沙！

17:58.400 --> 17:59.367
NO MORE.
不再。

17:59.433 --> 18:01.067
BUT MR. KRABS...
但是先生。螃蟹...

18:01.133 --> 18:02.300
SHH!
嘘！

18:02.367 --> 18:04.667
NO MORE OF THIS
KARATE STUFF, LAD
不再这样了
空手道的东西，小伙子

18:04.733 --> 18:06.700
OR YOU'RE FIRED.
或者你被解雇了。

18:09.067 --> 18:10.633
( in high voice ):
FIRED?
（高声）：
被解雇？

18:11.400 --> 18:13.100
NO MORE KARATE?
不再空手道了？

18:13.167 --> 18:15.100
HOW AM I GOING TO TELL SANDY?
我该怎么告诉桑迪？

18:15.167 --> 18:17.067
KI...AI!
气...艾！

18:17.100 --> 18:18.333
I CAN'T.
我不能。

18:18.400 --> 18:20.400
MR. KRABS SAID I HAVE
TO GIVE UP KARATE.
先生。蟹蟹说我有
放弃空手道。

18:20.467 --> 18:22.067
UH-HUH,
SURE, SPONGEBOB.
嗯嗯，
当然，海绵宝宝。

18:22.133 --> 18:25.933
NO, REALLY, SANDY, STOP.
不，真的，桑迪，停下来。

18:26.067 --> 18:28.767
I'M NOT
FALLING FOR IT,
SPONGEBOB.
我不是
爱上它，
海绵宝宝。

18:28.833 --> 18:29.833
NO, REALLY!
不，真的！

18:29.900 --> 18:31.067
PLEASE STOP.
请停下来。

18:31.100 --> 18:32.667
WHAT THE...
什么...

18:32.733 --> 18:34.500
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

18:34.567 --> 18:35.500
( screams )
（尖叫声）

18:35.567 --> 18:36.900
MR. KRABS.
先生。螃蟹。

18:36.967 --> 18:39.967
WHAT DID I JUST GET THROUGH
TELLING YOU, LAD?
我刚刚经历了什么
告诉你，小伙子？

18:40.067 --> 18:41.700
BUT, I... SHE...
但是，我……她……

18:41.767 --> 18:44.967
SPONGEBOB, YOU'RE FIRED!
海绵宝宝，你被解雇了！

18:45.067 --> 18:45.600
HUH?
嗯？

18:46.900 --> 18:47.633
FIRED?
被解雇？

18:50.633 --> 18:51.567
HEY?
嘿？

18:51.633 --> 18:52.800
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

18:52.867 --> 18:56.467
( starts sobbing )
（开始抽泣）

18:56.533 --> 19:00.767
( bawling )
（嚎啕大哭）

19:00.833 --> 19:04.067
WAIT-- MR. KRABS,
IT'S NOT HIS FAULT.
等等——先生。螃蟹，
这不是他的错。

19:04.067 --> 19:05.200
IT'S MINE.
这是我的。

19:05.267 --> 19:08.933
HE TRIED TO TELL ME,
BUT I WOULDN'T LISTEN.
他试图告诉我，
但我不听。

19:14.333 --> 19:17.533
GIVE HIM ANOTHER
CHANCE... PLEASE?
再给他一个
机会...请吗？

19:17.600 --> 19:20.900
HMM.
唔。

19:20.967 --> 19:22.267
ALL RIGHT, ME BOY.
好吧，我的孩子。

19:22.333 --> 19:24.600
I'LL GIVE YOU A SECOND CHANCE.
我会给你第二次机会。

19:24.667 --> 19:27.067
BUT NO MORE KARATE.
但不再是空手道了。

19:27.067 --> 19:29.800
IT'S POISONING
YOUR MIND.
中毒了
你的想法。

19:29.867 --> 19:30.800
( sniffs )
（嗅）

19:30.867 --> 19:33.267
MMM, MAMMALS.
嗯，哺乳动物。

19:33.333 --> 19:35.933
AW, SHOOT, SPONGEBOB.
哇，开枪，海绵宝宝。

19:36.067 --> 19:38.533
I GUESS YOU
AIN'T FIBBING.
我猜你
不是撒谎。

19:38.600 --> 19:40.900
( both sigh )
（两人都叹息）

19:40.967 --> 19:44.067
AW... THAT GAME WAS
GETTING OLD, ANYWAY.
噢……那场比赛是
无论如何，都会变老。

19:44.067 --> 19:45.500
IT'S NOT FUN ANYMORE.
这不再有趣了。

19:45.567 --> 19:48.100
I MEAN, WHAT'S
SO FUN ABOUT... THIS?
我的意思是，什么是
这么有趣……这个？

19:49.700 --> 19:50.733
( laughing )
（笑）

19:52.967 --> 19:54.067
NOTHING!
没有什么！

19:54.067 --> 19:56.067
NOTHING IS FUN
ABOUT THAT AT ALL.
没什么好玩的
关于这一点。

19:56.100 --> 19:57.633
WE CAN FIND
SOMETHING TO DO
我们可以找到
有事可做

19:57.700 --> 19:59.700
THAT'S AT LEAST
NINE TIMES AS FUN.
至少是这样
九倍有趣。

19:59.767 --> 20:00.900
WE CAN?
我们可以吗？

20:00.967 --> 20:03.067
I MEAN... SURE WE CAN.
我的意思是……我们当然可以。

20:03.133 --> 20:04.533
YEAH!
是的！

20:04.600 --> 20:06.333
LIKE WE CAN, UH...
就像我们可以的那样，呃...

20:06.400 --> 20:08.267
WE CAN SQUEEZE THINGS.
我们可以压缩东西。

20:08.333 --> 20:11.533
( grunting and groaning )
（咕哝和呻吟）

20:11.600 --> 20:12.667
WHOO-HOO!
呼呼！

20:12.733 --> 20:13.967
HOW MUCH FUN WAS THAT?
那有多有趣？

20:14.033 --> 20:15.300
ALMOST SOME.
几乎有一些。

20:17.233 --> 20:18.000
I KNOW.
我知道。

20:18.067 --> 20:19.900
WE CAN ACT LIKE PLANTS.
我们可以像植物一样行动。

20:19.967 --> 20:22.500
PHOTOSYNTHESIS.
光合作用。

20:22.567 --> 20:24.667
PHOTOSYNTHESIS.
光合作用。

20:24.733 --> 20:26.367
WANT TO GO
TO THE PARK?
想去
去公园？

20:27.833 --> 20:30.200
KARATE
SURE IS DUMB.
空手道
肯定是愚蠢的。

20:30.267 --> 20:31.900
YEAH, YOU CAN
SAY THAT AGAIN.
是的，你可以
再说一遍。

20:31.967 --> 20:34.400
I FEEL DUMB JUST
THINKING ABOUT IT.
我觉得自己很蠢
思考一下。

20:34.467 --> 20:37.033
DUH... I'M STUPID.
呃...我很愚蠢。

20:37.100 --> 20:39.167
I LIKE KARATE.
我喜欢空手道。

20:39.233 --> 20:40.167
DOY...
多伊...

20:40.233 --> 20:41.533
YOU LIKE WHAT?
你喜欢什么？

20:41.600 --> 20:43.133
NOT KARATE.
不是空手道。

20:43.200 --> 20:45.067
HA! I DON'T EVEN
KNOW WHAT THAT IS.
哈！我什至不
知道那是什么。

20:45.133 --> 20:46.733
I DON'T KNOW
WHAT ANYTHING IS.
我不知道
什么都是什么。

20:46.800 --> 20:48.033
IN FACT...
实际上...

20:48.100 --> 20:49.033
Man:
KIAI!
男士：
凯艾！

20:49.100 --> 20:50.967
KIAI!
凯艾！

20:51.033 --> 20:53.633
( giggling )
（咯咯笑）

20:53.700 --> 20:55.533
FOR A SECOND,
THAT SOUNDED LIKE...
一秒钟，
听起来像是……

20:55.600 --> 20:56.667
KARATE?
空手道？

20:56.733 --> 20:57.733
RIGHT NOW?
现在？

20:57.800 --> 21:00.567
I MEAN... NO,
WHAT IS THIS KARATE?
我的意思是...不，
这是什么空手道？

21:00.633 --> 21:02.667
UH, WHAT DO YOU WANT
ON YOUR SANDWICH?
呃，你想要什么
在你的三明治上吗？

21:02.733 --> 21:03.533
KARATE.
空手道。

21:03.600 --> 21:04.533
WHAT DID YOU SAY?
你说什么？

21:04.600 --> 21:06.100
UH, MUSTARD--
MUSTARD.
呃，芥末——
芥末。

21:06.167 --> 21:08.300
I WANT MUSTARD
ON MY SANDWICH.
我想要芥末
在我的三明治上。

21:08.367 --> 21:09.367
THERE WE GO.
我们开始了。

21:11.133 --> 21:12.800
HOW MANY SLICES
OF BARNACLE LOAF DO YOU WANT?
有多少片
您想要藤壶面包吗？

21:12.867 --> 21:14.733
ONE... JUST ONE.
一……就一。

21:14.800 --> 21:16.800
ONE FOR YOU...
为您准备的...

21:16.867 --> 21:18.133
HMM?
唔？

21:18.200 --> 21:20.500
AND ONE FOR ME!
还有一个给我的！

21:23.067 --> 21:24.100
OH, UH...
哦，呃...

21:24.167 --> 21:25.333
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

21:25.400 --> 21:27.400
MAYBE JUST ONE MORE.
也许还需要一个。

21:27.467 --> 21:28.800
I'M KIND OF HUNGRY.
我有点饿了。

21:28.867 --> 21:29.800
SURE THING, SANDY.
当然可以，桑迪。

21:29.867 --> 21:31.533
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

21:31.600 --> 21:32.733
DO YOU THINK, UM...
你认为，嗯...

21:32.800 --> 21:34.700
DO YOU THINK
I COULD CUT THIS ONE?
你认为
我可以剪这个吗？

21:34.767 --> 21:36.333
UH, SURE.
呃，当然。

21:36.400 --> 21:37.333
THANKS.
谢谢。

21:37.400 --> 21:39.467
( yells )
（大喊）

21:39.533 --> 21:40.900
IS THAT ENOUGH?
够了吗？

21:40.967 --> 21:42.867
MAYBE JUST ONE MORE.
也许还需要一个。

21:43.667 --> 21:44.433
OR TWO.
或两个。

21:44.500 --> 21:45.167
OR THREE.
或三个。

21:45.233 --> 21:45.900
OR TEN.
或十个。

21:45.967 --> 21:47.067
TEN, YES, TEN!
十，是的，十！

21:47.067 --> 21:48.300
BECAUSE WE'RE REALLY HUNGRY.
因为我们真的很饿。

21:48.367 --> 21:48.833
RIGHT!
正确的！

21:48.900 --> 21:49.367
RIGHT!
正确的！

21:49.433 --> 21:49.900
RIGHT!
正确的！

21:49.967 --> 21:51.067
RIGHT!
正确的！

21:52.067 --> 21:53.600
TIME FOR BUNS!
吃包子的时间到了！

21:53.667 --> 21:54.900
( yelling )
（大喊）

21:54.967 --> 21:56.567
HOW ABOUT
SOME TOMATOES?
怎么样
一些西红柿？

21:56.633 --> 21:57.867
AND I'LL
CUT THE CHEESE.
我会
切奶酪。

21:57.933 --> 22:00.433
( both yell )
（两人都大喊）

22:02.167 --> 22:02.833
AND WHAT ELSE?
还有什么？

22:02.900 --> 22:03.733
MORE BUNS!
更多面包！

22:03.800 --> 22:04.433
AND LETTUCE!
还有生菜！

22:04.500 --> 22:05.867
YEAH!
YEAH!
是的！
是的！

22:05.933 --> 22:10.367
( chopping frantically )
（疯狂地砍）

22:10.433 --> 22:13.200
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

22:13.267 --> 22:15.300
MAKING SANDWICHES SURE IS FUN.
制作三明治确实很有趣。

22:15.367 --> 22:16.333
RIGHT, SANDY?
对吧，桑迪？

22:16.400 --> 22:17.633
RIGHT?
正确的？

22:17.700 --> 22:20.067
I GUESS I'LL EAT ONE NOW.
我想我现在就吃一个。

22:24.067 --> 22:26.067
YOU'RE MINCEMEAT.
你是肉末。

22:26.133 --> 22:29.267
IN YOUR DREAMS!
在你的梦想中！

22:29.333 --> 22:32.667
( both yelling and shouting )
（又叫又喊）

22:36.133 --> 22:37.867
HUH? WHAT THE BARNACLE...?
嗯？藤壶是什么……？

22:41.767 --> 22:44.600
DO YOU THINK
MR. KRABS EVER DOES KARATE?
你认为
先生。蟹蟹会空手道吗？

22:44.667 --> 22:45.467
( clears his throat )
（清了清喉咙）

22:45.533 --> 22:46.467
( screams )
（尖叫声）

22:46.533 --> 22:47.967
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

22:48.067 --> 22:51.267
UH, HEY, MR. KRABS,
HOW'S IT GOING?
呃，嘿，先生。螃蟹，
怎么样？

22:51.333 --> 22:52.367
NICE DAY, HUH?
美好的一天，嗯？

22:54.600 --> 22:58.067
OH, ALL RIGHT, MR. KRABS,
YOU CAUGHT ME.
哦，好吧，先生。螃蟹，
你抓住了我。

22:58.067 --> 22:59.133
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT?
但你知道吗？

22:59.200 --> 23:00.800
I JUST CAN'T HELP MYSELF.
我就是情不自禁。

23:00.867 --> 23:03.100
YOU'RE JUST GOING
TO HAVE TO FIRE ME.
你就这样走了
必须解雇我。

23:03.167 --> 23:04.367
FIRE YOU?
解雇你？

23:04.433 --> 23:07.367
I GOT SOMETHING ELSE IN MIND.
我还有别的想法。

23:08.467 --> 23:09.867
( fast chopping inside )
（里面快速切碎）

23:09.933 --> 23:11.733
( crowd cheering )
（人群欢呼）

23:12.733 --> 23:14.633
( chopping continues )
（砍伐继续）

23:14.700 --> 23:16.800
( crowd cheering )
（人群欢呼）

23:16.867 --> 23:18.633
I LOVE KARATE!
我喜欢空手道！

23:18.700 --> 23:20.400
I LOVE KARA-TAY!
我爱卡拉泰！

23:20.467 --> 23:22.400
I LOVE MONEY-AY!
我爱钱——哎呀！

23:22.467 --> 23:24.867
I HATE ALL OF YOU.
我恨你们所有人。

